<title>USA: Candie's won't' redeem warrants early.</title>
<headline>Candie's won't' redeem warrants early.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Candie's Inc said Thursday that it would not redeem its outstanding Class C warrants, even if it became entitled to do so, at any time prior to their expiration date of February 23, 1998.</p>
</text>
